  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">An Opaque Mirror For Trajan (2024), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 962 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">An Opaque Mirror For Trajan by Laurens van der Wiel was published by Leuven University Press in 2024. Conceptually, the work connects to Barbarian, Ruler, Emperor, Context (archaeology) and Literature.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 962 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Quality Education among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven.</p>",
